msgid "**为什么失败**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:491
msgid "MNIST 数字只占图像中心一小块，大小相对固定"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:492
msgid "5×5 卷积核几乎覆盖了整个数字，没有\"多尺度\"的必要"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:493
msgid "增加的分支引入了更多参数，但没有带来信息增益"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:495
msgid "**教训**：**感受野策略的前提是\"确实存在多尺度\"**。如果任务本身尺度单一（如对齐良好的人脸、固定大小的字符），多尺度就是浪费。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:497
msgid "案例二：分割任务中空洞率过大"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:499
msgid "**场景**：医学图像分割（细胞分割），你用空洞率 16 的 3×3 卷积来扩大感受野。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:503
msgid "大细胞分割还可以"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:504
msgid "**小细胞大量丢失**——在特征图上彻底\"消失\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:508
msgid "空洞率 16 意味着卷积核实际采样点间距为 16 像素"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:509
msgid "对于直径只有 20-30 像素的细胞，3×3 空洞卷积只能看到 3 个采样点"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:510
msgid "信息严重欠采样，小目标被\"跳过\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:512
msgid "**教训**：**空洞卷积的上限是目标最小尺寸**。如果目标只有 20 像素，空洞率不应超过 5-7。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:514
msgid "案例三：分类任务盲目用 FPN"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:516
msgid "**场景**：ImageNet 分类，你把 ResNet 改造成了 FPN 结构——多尺度输出、自上而下连接。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:520
msgid "参数量和计算量显著增加"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:521
msgid "Top-5 准确率没有提升，甚至略有下降"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:525
msgid "FPN 的核心价值是**多尺度目标的定位和分类**（检测/分割）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:526
msgid "分类任务只需要一个全局判断，不需要\"每层都输出\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:527
msgid "额外的上采样和融合引入了计算负担，但没有对应的收益"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:529
msgid "**教训**：**FPN 是为目标检测/分割设计的，不是为纯分类**。分类任务用 FPN 是\"杀鸡用牛刀\"。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:531
msgid "决策树：什么时候用什么"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:550
msgid "**核心原则**：感受野改造是为了解决**特定问题**，不是为了\"看起来厉害\"。如果 baseline 没有明显问题，不要引入复杂度。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:552
msgid "信息论视角：多尺度 = 多频段采样"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:554
#, python-brace-format
msgid "从信息论来看，感受野策略都是**多频段采样**{cite}`tishby2000information`："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:556
#, python-brace-format
msgid "自然界图像的{ref}`mutual-information`分布在不同的空间频率上"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:557
msgid "小感受野捕捉高频（细节），大感受野捕捉低频（全局结构）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:558
msgid "单一感受野 = 信息窄带采样，丢失其他频段的信息"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part2-receptive-field.md:559
msgid "多尺度策略 = 宽带采样，**最大化 $I(X;Y)$**"
msgstr ""

